  "_grindGroupsComment": "Each objective pays its award (coins, or a pack delivered to My Packs, untradeable when the award says so) and xp once its stat reaches target; the group award pays once every objective in it is claimed. Stats count from the club's creation. Pack ids are FIFA 21 reward packs: 402 Jumbo Rare Players, 403 Mega, 404 Rare Mega, 405 Ultimate, 542 TOTW Player (1 in-form), 543 Small Rare Gold Players, and 513-516 the 82+-88+ player picks. Group 8, New Club, is the permanent version of the week-one group, so a club gets the same start whenever it joins. SBC completion counts once per challenge per club ever (a repeatable set's repeats, such as the Upgrades, pay their rewards but count for neither sbcs nor Season XP), so an sbcs target above the visible challenge count can never be met. Groups 20-22 are retail's Stadium Development milestones: each objective opens My Stadium slots (unlockSlots, rules/club.json myStadiumSlots ids) and pays a pack of My Stadium items (vanity: count unowned items of those card subtypes); groups 20 and 21 move the club up a FUT Stadium tier (stadiumTier, venues.futStadiums 444 Challengers and 445 Champions). Group 20 follows retail (fifauteam.com milestones); groups 21 and 22 are reconstructed (no retail list survives) to open every remaining slot by 85 matches and 60 wins.",
