  "_giftsComment": "One-off gifts: a group served while its window is open (with stat and target the club earns it first: phase 1's needs five matches, owner 2026-09-29; without them it is served already completed) (availableFrom / availableUntil, ISO 8601 with a UTC offset, both inclusive; null leaves that side open), claimable once per club inside the window and delivered to My Packs. A gift's id is claimed in the group scope, so it must not be a group id. Phase 1: one 542 (a TOTW in-form), untradeable, for any club that claims it before Sun 4 Oct 2026 23:59 UK time. Set availableFrom to make it land at a later date.",
